{"ref":"BDB, צָבַר","hw":"צָבַר","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צָבַר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. heap up (</strong>NH id.<em>;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">צְבַר</span>; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܨܒܰܪ</span> is <em>prate, chatter, rave;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">ضَبَرَ</span> is <em>collect, bind together;</em> cf. further Dozy<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצְבֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:49\" href=\"/Genesis.41.49\">Gn 41:49</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:7\" href=\"/Psalms.39.7\">ψ 39:7</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּצְבָּר־</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.3\">Zc 9:3</a>, etc.;—<em>heap up</em>, in great quantity: c. acc. corn <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:35\" href=\"/Genesis.41.35\">Gn 41:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:49\" href=\"/Genesis.41.49\">49</a> (E), dead frogs <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:10\" href=\"/Exodus.8.10\">Ex 8:10</a> (J), dust <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:10\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.10\">Hb 1:10</a>, silver like dust <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.3\">Zc 9:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:16\" href=\"/Job.27.16\">Jb 27:16</a>, cf. (obj. om.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:7\" href=\"/Psalms.39.7\">ψ 39:7</a>.","next":"BDB, צִבּוּר","prev":"BDB, צְבֹעִים"}